zbar is vendored here for QR decoding from iOS 5 camera frames.

source: https://github.com/mchehab/zbar
revision: 2ea2ca585b10a07e528af08ddf8890756e059b5b
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later, see COPYING

Senko builds only the QR reader. Camera capture and UIKit integration remain
in qr_scan.m. This copy excludes video, window, image-file and every non-QR
barcode backend.

Local patch: zbar/img_scanner.c movedelta() steps the pixel pointer with a
signed offset. Upstream adds a negative dx to an uintptr_t product, so every
backward scan step moved the pointer by an overflowed unsigned offset, which
UBSan reports and an optimizer may miscompile.

Local patch: zbar/scanner.c interpolates the zero crossing with a
multiplication instead of shifting a negative value left.

Local patch: zbar/qrcode/util.h QR_MINI and QR_MAXI compare instead of
subtracting. The branchless form computed b - a, which overflows int when the
line fit seeds its bounds with INT_MIN and INT_MAX.
